WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.270
CLASS 3

00:01.830 --> 00:05.800
And so, our new transfer student is...

00:05.800 --> 00:09.470
Is a little odd, but...

00:09.980 --> 00:15.030
But I would appreciate it if you could be 
as kind and patient with him as possible.

00:15.340 --> 00:17.440
Do you understand, Yunyun-kun?

00:17.440 --> 00:20.710
Yes, Kyouhukou-sensei!

00:20.710 --> 00:24.370
No matter who he is, 
I'll try my best to be his friend.

00:24.370 --> 00:27.190
That's just what I'd hoped
 you'd say, Yunyun-kun.

00:27.190 --> 00:31.670
So, when is he coming?

00:31.670 --> 00:35.820
Hm... he should be here by now.

00:39.820 --> 00:44.850
I am Kitamura Motoyasu, 
the Spear Hero! And I am here!

00:47.440 --> 00:51.220
The first time you see Sensei 
it can be a little surprising, huh?

00:51.220 --> 00:54.540
Oh, my apologies.

01:01.190 --> 01:04.420
It's not me you're reacting to, but Yunyun-kun?

01:05.330 --> 01:08.330
C-Classmate...

01:08.610 --> 01:10.750
Classmate?

01:11.010 --> 01:12.820
Pi-Pi...

01:13.510 --> 01:14.570
Pi?

01:15.340 --> 01:17.930
My classmate is a pig?!

01:18.550 --> 01:20.310
Yunyun-kun?!

01:26.190 --> 01:33.810
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

02:47.560 --> 02:51.010
ISEKAI QUARTET 3

02:51.020 --> 02:53.110
Episode 5: Attack! Of the Spear Hero
CLASS 2

02:52.110 --> 02:59.450
Even if she got called a pig, she got 
sent to the guidance room for a lecture.

02:53.110 --> 02:56.040
Episode 5: Attack! Of the Spear Hero

02:59.450 --> 03:02.820
A crimson demon never lets 
an insult go unanswered.

03:02.820 --> 03:05.180
Well done, Yunyun.

03:05.180 --> 03:07.350
I don't think it's something 
to compliment.

03:07.670 --> 03:10.170
I do feel bad for her, though.

03:11.120 --> 03:13.740
I think pigs are cute.

03:14.100 --> 03:16.790
Emilia-tan, that's not it.

03:16.790 --> 03:21.950
Calling someone a pig is an insult. 
You're saying they're fat.

03:21.950 --> 03:23.640
You shouldn't insult people, yeah!

03:23.640 --> 03:26.970
And I don't think Yunyun is fat.

03:26.970 --> 03:31.300
Correct. She's just a fast grower.

03:31.300 --> 03:32.450
But...

03:33.480 --> 03:37.230
I don't think the two of you are 
ever going to be called that.

03:37.230 --> 03:40.170
What exactly does that mean?

03:41.220 --> 03:45.060
I just told you that a crimson demon never 
lets an insult go unanswered, right?

03:45.060 --> 03:47.530
Knock it off, you two!

03:48.730 --> 03:50.970
I'm just telling the truth!

03:49.770 --> 03:53.580
So, where's the transfer student now?

03:53.870 --> 03:59.450
I heard he ran out of the classroom 
screaming nonsense.

04:00.990 --> 04:05.300
Sheesh... none of this makes any sense.

04:05.300 --> 04:08.590
I find myself in this strange world,

04:08.590 --> 04:12.270
and there's pigs oinking at me, slapping me...

04:12.670 --> 04:16.010
And I can't strike back because 
my spear seems broken...

04:18.060 --> 04:22.290
It seems this world has many restrictions.

04:23.220 --> 04:27.570
But my job doesn't change, 
regardless of what world I'm in!

04:27.570 --> 04:32.130
It's to meet Filo-tan! And other Filolials!

04:32.130 --> 04:36.170
I will not give up on being a hunter of love!

04:37.940 --> 04:41.510
But where is Filo-tan?

04:41.510 --> 04:43.430
I can't wait to see her.

04:45.110 --> 04:47.390
Rem, are you feeling okay?

04:47.390 --> 04:51.300
Yes, I've been doing well lately, thanks to you.

04:54.010 --> 04:59.140
It feels like my head's been cloudy for 
a long time, but it's about to clear up.

05:00.830 --> 05:01.620
I see.

05:02.370 --> 05:03.610
I'm glad to hear that.

05:06.160 --> 05:08.170
T... T...

05:09.380 --> 05:12.530
Twin pigs are oinking!

05:17.190 --> 05:22.250
So Class 3 has a new transfer student, huh?

05:22.250 --> 05:25.620
Yeah, but it's this weird human.

05:25.620 --> 05:28.770
He calls whoever he sees a pig.

05:28.770 --> 05:32.890
Calling people pigs? That's so rude!

05:32.890 --> 05:41.190
But wouldn't it be nice to have a supreme being 
call you a pig and pin you to the ground?

05:41.190 --> 05:45.400
Even if it's somebody you liked, 
that's still too perverted for me.

05:45.400 --> 05:51.030
But, i-if it were the right person, 
it might be kind of fun... maybe.

05:51.030 --> 05:53.490
Yeah, I wouldn't mind.

05:56.130 --> 05:58.090
This is the nurse's office, right?

05:59.380 --> 06:02.040
Slutty squirming pigs!

06:03.510 --> 06:06.610
He's probably right, but I'll 
go bury him anyway, okay?

06:06.610 --> 06:07.870
Thanks!

06:13.340 --> 06:15.770
Are you okay?

06:15.770 --> 06:17.610
I'm fine.

06:18.110 --> 06:21.770
Sheesh... is this a world of pigs?

06:21.770 --> 06:24.740
You're a very rude person.

06:25.570 --> 06:27.940
I can't wait to see my angel.

06:27.940 --> 06:29.320
Angel?

06:29.320 --> 06:32.340
Yes! Filo-tan!

06:32.340 --> 06:34.590
If you're looking for 
Filo-dono from class 1,

06:34.590 --> 06:37.900
she's probably in the music 
room with Naofumi-dono.

06:37.900 --> 06:39.330
Really?

06:39.330 --> 06:40.790
And she's with Father?

06:40.790 --> 06:44.420
Father? Who's that?

06:44.420 --> 06:46.880
Father's name is Naofumi!

06:48.150 --> 06:52.970
I don't know who you are, sir, 
but I can't thank you enough!

06:52.970 --> 06:56.300
I'm glad you're happy.

06:56.300 --> 06:58.560
Wait for me, Filo-tan!

06:58.560 --> 07:04.570
Your hunter of love is on his way!

07:07.020 --> 07:09.810
What was that about?

07:09.810 --> 07:13.340
Hamsuke-dono, is something wrong?

07:13.340 --> 07:19.630
Something very strange just happened! 
I just met Naofumi-dono's son!

07:19.630 --> 07:21.710
Naofumi-dono's son?

07:22.110 --> 07:26.630
He's so young, but his son's so big! Wow!

07:26.630 --> 07:29.790
I can't wait to find a partner too, and...

07:29.790 --> 07:32.340
Is something wrong, Wilhelm-dono?

07:32.340 --> 07:33.450
No...

07:43.900 --> 07:45.860
Is that the new transfer student 
everyone's been talking about?

07:45.860 --> 07:47.430
Where?

07:47.940 --> 07:50.180
The one who says everyone looks like a pig?

07:50.180 --> 07:50.900
Oh?

07:51.950 --> 07:55.440
Mr. Skeleton, I have a favor to ask.

07:55.440 --> 07:58.010
Can you tell me where Filo-tan is?

07:58.010 --> 07:59.620
Huh? ..."tan"?

07:59.620 --> 08:02.780
Looks like Ains doesn't seem to be a pig to him.

08:00.900 --> 08:02.780
Filo-kun, you mean?

08:02.780 --> 08:05.500
Indeed! The lady I live for!

08:03.830 --> 08:07.070
It seems there's a rule 
for who looks like a pig.

08:05.500 --> 08:08.770
If you don't know where she is, 
you can tell me where my father is.

08:07.790 --> 08:11.990
By the way, Albedo, what would you 
do if someone called you a pig?

08:08.770 --> 08:11.470
I'm afraid I don't know who your parents are.

08:11.990 --> 08:12.810
A foolish question.

08:12.810 --> 08:16.760
Okay, Albedo, you can just 
keep on standing behind me.

08:17.250 --> 08:18.430
Um...

08:18.430 --> 08:20.210
<i>This is bad.</i>

08:20.210 --> 08:21.990
Th-This is...

08:21.290 --> 08:23.730
Wait, not another word.

08:30.850 --> 08:32.450
An angel!

08:35.490 --> 08:36.830
Those wings...

08:36.830 --> 08:39.380
The beautiful ahoge on your head...

08:39.380 --> 08:40.470
Ahoge?

08:40.470 --> 08:42.410
You must be a Filolial!

08:42.410 --> 08:43.790
No, that's wrong.

08:43.790 --> 08:48.390
And so the young lady next to 
you must be a child Filolial.

08:49.130 --> 08:51.630
You're hiding your wings, yes!

08:51.630 --> 08:54.480
But your beautiful ahoge remains!

08:54.480 --> 08:56.590
Oh, uh... yeah.

08:56.970 --> 08:59.520
It is an honor to meet you
in a world like this!

08:59.520 --> 09:03.300
Mr. Skeleton, you must share 
the same beliefs as me!

09:03.300 --> 09:05.350
Um, well...

09:05.850 --> 09:10.700
I'd love to talk with you more 
about the greatness of Filolials.

09:10.700 --> 09:13.400
But I must go to see Filo-tan!

09:13.400 --> 09:14.860
Oh, uh... okay.

09:15.180 --> 09:17.710
Please tell me, Mr. Skeleton!

09:17.710 --> 09:20.120
Where can I find the music 
room where she's located?

09:20.120 --> 09:22.670
The music room is just down the hall.

09:23.230 --> 09:26.740
My thanks!

09:28.850 --> 09:31.180
What was that?

09:31.180 --> 09:36.350
Ains-sama! That human called me your angel!

09:36.350 --> 09:37.810
Yeah, he didn't say that.

09:37.810 --> 09:39.590
Ains-sama!

09:38.140 --> 09:43.060
Also, you're a succubus. Should you 
be happy about being called an angel?

09:46.520 --> 09:48.520
Filo-tan!

09:48.520 --> 09:50.430
All I see are pigs!

09:51.670 --> 09:56.320
Hey, you think you can just 
come in here and call us pigs?!

09:56.320 --> 09:59.010
Reinhard, go bury him.

09:59.010 --> 10:03.700
Sorry. I'll make sure your head's 
still above the ground, okay?

10:09.420 --> 10:12.020
Oh, Naofumi-san and his friends.

10:12.880 --> 10:14.380
Leaving early?

10:14.380 --> 10:16.780
Yeah, I've just got these terrible chills.

10:16.780 --> 10:19.530
I feel awful for some reason.

10:19.530 --> 10:22.580
We're going home early today.

10:22.580 --> 10:24.640
I see.

10:24.640 --> 10:26.660
Get some rest.
